{"id":"f58c99f46583f2b7","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-residuated-inequality.md","title":"Residuated Inequality","display":"Residuated Inequality","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-residuated-inequality","aliases":["93-fact-residuated-inequality"],"display":"Residuated Inequality","depends_on":["[[93-df-residuated]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-residuated-inequality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-residuated-inequality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Residuated Inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69fd12190649a7f7\" href=\"?note=69fd12190649a7f7\" title=\"93-df-residuated\">93-df-residuated</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\">\\(x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-},\\cdot^{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-},\\cdot^{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> are the induced reduct order and multiplication.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}inequality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\n\\land x\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}y\n\\to x\\cdot^{\\mathbf A}z\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}y\\cdot^{\\mathbf A}z\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}inequality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\n\\land x\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}y\n\\to x\\cdot^{\\mathbf A}z\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}y\\cdot^{\\mathbf A}z\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The residuated inequality fact captures the fundamental property of residuated structures: the monoid multiplication is monotone in its left argument. In residuated lattices (such as Heyting algebras), this ensures that the residual operation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a \\backslash b\">\\(a \\backslash b\\)</span> (the largest <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> such that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a \\cdot x \\leq b\">\\(a \\cdot x \\leq b\\)</span>) is well-defined and satisfies the adjunction property linking multiplication and implication.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-residuated","status":"resolved","id":"69fd12190649a7f7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-residuated]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-},\\cdot^{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}inequality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf A|\n\\land x\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}y\n\\to x\\cdot^{\\mathbf A}z\\leq_{\\mathbf A^-}y\\cdot^{\\mathbf A}z","display":true},{"tex":"a \\backslash b","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"a \\cdot x \\leq b","display":false}],"bytes":1061,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["69fd12190649a7f7"]}